                "Fields": {
                    "description": "List fields as schema XML. A missing one is created; one that exists is updated in place, never deleted: a widening type change (Text to Note, Lookup or User single to multi) is applied, another type change is a warning and leaves it as it is. A new target (a lookup's list, a taxonomy field's term set) is applied on a list made in this setup, otherwise a warning that keeps the stored one.",
